---
// Marginalia Atlas: an annotated calculation plate where changing Q alters comparison weights, then the V mixture.
---
<section class="lab attention-path" aria-labelledby="attention-path-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">INTERACTIVE / COMPLETE NUMERIC PATH</p>
  <h2 id="attention-path-title">Q を変え、output が変わる道筋を見る</h2>
  <p>二つの key <code>k₁=[1,1]</code>、<code>k₂=[1,-1]</code> と、二つの value <code>v₁=[2,0]</code>、<code>v₂=[0,3]</code> は固定です。<strong>query の二成分を動かし、score → softmax weight → value の混合</strong>がどう変わるかを観察してください。</p>
  <div class="path-controls" aria-label="query を変更するスライダー">
    <label>q₁ <input id="query-one" type="range" min="-2" max="2" step="0.5" value="1" /> <output id="query-one-output">1.0</output></label>
    <label>q₂ <input id="query-two" type="range" min="-2" max="2" step="0.5" value="0" /> <output id="query-two-output">0.0</output></label>
  </div>
  <div class="calc-table" aria-live="polite">
    <div><span>score</span><strong id="scores">[1.00, 1.00]</strong><small>q·k₁, q·k₂</small></div>
    <div><span>weight</span><strong id="weights">[0.50, 0.50]</strong><small>softmax(score)</small></div>
    <div><span>output</span><strong id="output-vector">[1.00, 1.50]</strong><small>0.50v₁ + 0.50v₂</small></div>
  </div>
  <aside class="note"><strong>この実験から分かること:</strong> Q と K は「どの value をどれだけ混ぜるか」を決めます。V は比較には使わず、決まった比率で運ばれる内容です。実モデルでは Q/K/V は同じ入力に学習済み行列を掛けて作られます。</aside>
  <details><summary>操作しない場合の数値の読み方</summary><p>初期値 <code>q=[1,0]</code> では二つの score は同じ1なので、softmax weight は等しい0.5です。そのため output は <code>[2,0]</code> と <code>[0,3]</code> の中間 <code>[1,1.5]</code> になります。</p></details>
</section>
<script>
  const one = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#query-one");
  const two = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#query-two");
  const oneOutput = document.querySelector<HTMLOutputElement>("#query-one-output");
  const twoOutput = document.querySelector<HTMLOutputElement>("#query-two-output");
  const scoresOutput = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#scores");
  const weightsOutput = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#weights");
  const vectorOutput = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#output-vector");
  if (one && two && oneOutput && twoOutput && scoresOutput && weightsOutput && vectorOutput) {
    const format = (value: number) => Number(value).toFixed(2);
    const update = () => {
      const q1 = Number(one.value); const q2 = Number(two.value);
      const scores = [q1 + q2, q1 - q2]; const max = Math.max(...scores);
      const exps = scores.map((score) => Math.exp(score - max)); const sum = exps[0] + exps[1]; const weights = exps.map((value) => value / sum);
      const output = [weights[0] * 2, weights[1] * 3];
      oneOutput.textContent = q1.toFixed(1); twoOutput.textContent = q2.toFixed(1);
      scoresOutput.textContent = `[${format(scores[0])}, ${format(scores[1])}]`;
      weightsOutput.textContent = `[${format(weights[0])}, ${format(weights[1])}]`;
      vectorOutput.textContent = `[${format(output[0])}, ${format(output[1])}]`;
    };
    one.addEventListener("input", update); two.addEventListener("input", update);
  }
</script>
